<title>USA: Trenton, N.J., won by First Union.</title>
<headline>Trenton, N.J., won by First Union.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Union said it won $5.060 million</p>
<p>of Trenton, N.J., school bonds, Series 1996, with a lowest rate of</p>
<p>4.80 for $5,054,000.</p>
</text>
